-- The 92 doctors Merkezi Gomruk Hospitali publishes.
--
-- Read from customshospital.az on 2026-09-20, in Azerbaijani. The ninth
-- source, the Central Customs Hospital in Baku.
--
-- The count is 92 and comes from two of the hospital's own lists. The A to Z
-- page names 92 doctors; the by-department page names 90 and is a strict
-- subset of them. The two it leaves out, Ahmad Mammadov and Madina
-- Abdullayeva, have working profile pages and are filed under no department,
-- so their specialty is read from their own page instead: a dentist and an
-- infectious diseases specialist. The site's sitemap is no help - it is capped
-- at 500 URLs and holds only 55 of the doctors.
--
-- Specialty comes from the department list rather than from the profile page.
-- The profiles are free text on a page builder, and the doctor's own heading
-- repeats in the navigation, so reading the specialty from the page picks up
-- the language switcher as often as the specialty.
--
-- None of these doctors asked to be here. Every row is UNCLAIMED with
-- accepts_bookings = 0.
--
-- Six of these names already exist in this directory, and all six are other
-- people: this Gunay Ahmadova is a radiologist and the one at Referans is a
-- mammologist, this Tarana Goyushova is a paediatrician and the one at Liv is
-- an anaesthetist, and so on through three different Mammadovas. None needed a
-- suffixed slug, because the listings already here carry their titles in the
-- slug and these do not.
--
-- Two doctors have no portrait. Samir Agalarov publishes no photograph at all,
-- and every image on Saida Karimova's page is a screenshot of a patient's
-- Facebook comment rather than a picture of her. Shipping a review screenshot
-- as somebody's likeness would be absurd, so both fall back to initials.
--
-- One name had to be corrected against the profile page: the A to Z list
-- writes "Dr. Sevda H", which is where it was truncated, and her own page
-- gives Sevda Huseynova.
--
-- years_experience is years since the first medical degree ended; this source
-- publishes no length of service. Patient reviews are not imported.
--
-- Data only.

-- Oral and maxillofacial surgery: its own department here, and not the same as
-- plastic surgery or dentistry, which are the two it would otherwise be forced
-- into.
INSERT IGNORE INTO specialty (code, name_az, name_en, name_ru, patient_facing, ai_specialty_code, sort_order) VALUES
('maxillofacial-surgery','Üz-çənə cərrahiyyəsi','Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery','Челюстно-лицевая хирургия',1,'general',119);

INSERT INTO clinic (name, slug, address, city, phone, description, active, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT * FROM (SELECT
    'Mərkəzi Gömrük Hospitalı' AS name, 'merkezi-gomruk-hospitali' AS slug,
    'K. Kazımzadə küçəsi 118, Bakı' AS address, 'Bakı' AS city,
    '(012) 404-08-08' AS phone,
    'Mərkəzi Gömrük Hospitalı, Bakı. Siyahı hospitalın customshospital.az saytındakı həkim kataloqu əsasında hazırlanıb.' AS description,
    1 AS active, NOW() AS created_at, NOW() AS updated_at) AS c
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM clinic WHERE slug = 'merkezi-gomruk-hospitali');

-- INSERT IGNORE, not ON DUPLICATE KEY: MariaDB on production does not take
